WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.036 --> 00:00:07.507 line:0%
AROUND, THEN IT COMES DOWN TO

00:00:07.140 --> 00:00:10.343 line:0%
OTURU.

00:00:09.542 --> 00:00:17.650 line:0%
JASON PRESTON CROSSES HIM OUT.

00:00:12.812 --> 00:00:19.152 line:0%
PRESTON FLIPS IT OVER!

00:00:18.151 --> 00:00:26.559 line:0%
JASON PRESTON!

00:00:23.390 --> 00:00:28.528 line:0%
SAM: FIRST OF ALL, HE CROSSED

00:00:28.128 --> 00:00:29.929 line:0%
HIM OVER.

00:00:28.928 --> 00:00:31.965 line:0%
HE TOOK OFF -- LOOK AT THE

00:00:30.030 --> 00:00:32.866 line:0%
ENGLISH IN THE SPIN THAT HE PUT

00:00:32.065 --> 00:00:32.866 line:0%
ON THE BALL.

